      "title": "Pack C — read before queue",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Agent-Slate Pack C reference graph for Comfy Desk. Both stages ship bypassed (node mode 4) so opening this graph does not submit a Partner task.\n\nStage 1 scout — enable these nodes together (mode 0), queue once: model option Seedance 2.5 Draft, model id dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628, draft true, resolution 480p. Keep control_after_generate on fixed and keep the same seed integer. Save Text writes draft_task_id to a txt in the output folder. Use the same prompt and the same refs on the promote.\n\nStage 2 promote — within 7 days, paste that draft_task_id into ByteDance Seedance 2.5 Draft to Final Video, set Stage 1 back to bypass, set Stage 2 to mode 0, queue once. The final is native 1080p. Prompt, refs, duration, aspect ratio, seed, and generate_audio are inherited. There is no prompt field on the final node.\n\ngenerate_audio is false because post owns the soundtrack. Turn it on only when this take must carry its own dialogue or sound effects.\n\nA second Stage 1 queue creates a new draft. Leave Stage 1 bypassed once the preview is approved."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Agent-Slate Pack C reference graph for Comfy Desk. Both stages ship bypassed (node mode 4) so opening this graph does not submit a Partner task.\n\nStage 1 scout — enable these nodes together (mode 0), queue once: model option Seedance 2.5 Draft, model id dreamina-seedance-2-5-260628, draft true, resolution 480p. Keep control_after_generate on fixed and keep the same seed integer. Save Text writes draft_task_id to a txt in the output folder. Use the same prompt and the same refs on the promote.\n\nStage 2 promote — within 7 days, paste that draft_task_id into ByteDance Seedance 2.5 Draft to Final Video, set Stage 1 back to bypass, set Stage 2 to mode 0, queue once. The final is native 1080p. Prompt, refs, duration, aspect ratio, seed, and generate_audio are inherited. There is no prompt field on the final node.\n\ngenerate_audio is false because post owns the soundtrack. Turn it on only when this take must carry its own dialogue or sound effects.\n\nA second Stage 1 queue creates a new draft. Leave Stage 1 bypassed once the preview is approved."
      }
